<title>MALAYSIA: Hing Yiap stock debuts at 13.20 rgt.</title>
<headline>Hing Yiap stock debuts at 13.20 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hing Yiap Knitting Industries Bhd made their debut on the Kuala Lumpur bourse at 13.20 ringgit against an offer price of 3.30.</p>
<p>The Malaysian property and textile knitting firm offered three million vendor shares in its initial public offering for a listing on the second board of the exchange.</p>
